School Tem was added in '''Beta 30.0''' as a 1/2 for 3G Charge [[:Category:Tem|Tem]] with the additional ability of gaining +1/+1 if you summon a monster with more ATK than itself. '''Beta 55.0''' changed that to a Magic that requires you to burn a card in your hand (so remove it from play) with a cost of 2G or less. By doing so, it will gain ATK and HP equal to its cost (gaining nothing from a 0G card but still burn it). '''Beta 55.1''' buffed that by always giving it +2/+2, no matter the card's cost.

=== Stats ===
ATK: 1

HP: 2

Cost: 3

Abilities:

* Charge. Whenever you summon a monster with more ATK, gain +1/+1. (Post Beta 30.0)
* Charge. Magic: Burn a <= 2G card in your hand to ...
** gain its cost in ATK and HP. (Beta 55.0)
** gain +2/+2. (Post Beta 55.1, Current)

Rarity: Blue (Rare)
